From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nds-ports <nds-ports@localhost>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Nintendo DS build

Makefile.nds builds a .nds with devkitARM and libnds/calico, with the
Apogee v1.4 graphics layout, the game data from NITRO_DIR embedded
through NitroFS and ICON as the icon. The ray caster, the scaler, the
fixed point math and memcpy/memset run from ITCM as ARM code, the rest
is Thumb code in main RAM. Enums keep the size of an int, savegames hold
structs with them. The signon screen isn't shown, so its 64 KiB picture
isn't built in. The screen is the 320x200 frame of 8 bits, newlib has no
sys/uio.h.
---
 .gitignore   |  4 +++
 Makefile.nds | 79 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 id_ca.c      |  3 +-
 id_vl.c      |  6 ++--
 4 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Makefile.nds

